                <span begin="02:58.861" end="02:59.637">dreams</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我渴望在我的梦中见到你</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="03:06.276" end="03:13.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">
                <span begin="03:06.276" end="03:06.620">I'm </span>
                <span begin="03:06.620" end="03:07.564">trying </span>
                <span begin="03:07.564" end="03:08.076">to </span>
                <span begin="03:08.076" end="03:09.501">wake </span>
                <span begin="03:09.501" end="03:10.393">up </span>
                <span begin="03:12.129" end="03:13.865">again</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我竭尽全力 再次清醒过来</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </body>
</tt>
